# Copy to .env (gitignored, never committed) and fill in a real value to
# enable server/index.mjs's server-side hermes-gateway proxy (GET
# /gateway-status, POST /diagnose) — see README.md's "Human-in-the-loop
# review + self-improvement loop" / dashboard section, and
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-21-autonomous-layout-agent-design.md.
#
# Pattern: same as ~/gitspace/mi-report's profile .env (MI_LLM_API_KEY) —
# the server loads this automatically on startup (process.loadEnvFile()),
# so the browser never has to handle the key at all. Without it, the
# dashboard's Diagnosis page falls back to asking for a pasted key
# instead (still works, just less convenient).
#
# One of the values from GATEWAY_CLIENT_KEYS in the hermes-gateway
# instance's own .env (e.g. ~/gitspace/AIFde/.env), NOT a value to
# invent — this project doesn't run its own gateway.
PPA_EDA_GATEWAY_KEY=
